            "content_html": "<h3>字符串的定义、输出、输入、遍历</h3>\n<h6>字符串的定义</h6>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>最标准</strong>的定义方式：<code>char str[6] = {'H','e','l','l','o','\\0'};</code></li>\n<li>字符串数组</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://supermilk-niuru.github.io/posts/Learn_C_Language/字符串\" target=\"_blank\">https://supermilk-niuru.github.io/posts/Learn_C_Language/字符串</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
